-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, in the notes OP sent me, it did list to remove the 1/1 from the armor line, and then a few more requests down the list it said to remove the armor line. I thought it was weird, but thats what they asked me to do.<br /> <br /> I guess I can add it back for the Unofficial version if it's supposed to be there...</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. That is very odd. Well, if they wanted it gone, I guess that's cool. I'd sure love an unofficial version that did have an armor line, though!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T04:22:25-07:00","id":490401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=490158#post490158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh. That is very odd. Well, if they wanted it gone, I guess that's cool. I'd sure love an unofficial version that did have an armor line, though!</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought it was weird too, but I thought maybe they were saying you couldn't have armor in that form or something.<br /> <br /> But sure, I'll add it to my list of changes for the Unofficial version. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T17:05:52-07:00","id":491084,"title":"","content":"I'm working on the Unofficial sheet, just so everyone knows. I'm just waiting on the new xp costs(I don't have the book, so I'm waiting on a kind soul t type them up for me), and then it'll be ready. I'll let you guys knows when I'm done with it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T17:20:39-07:00","id":491091,"title":"","content":"Unlocking a new Shadow Gift costs 3 experiences if it's in-Auspice or in-Tribe, 5 experiences otherwise. Currently there is only one Moon Gift per Auspice, but once more are available, it'll cost 5 experiences to unlock a new one.<br /> Buying a new Facet of an unlocked Shadow or Moon Gift costs 2 experiences. Buying a new Facet of a Wolf Gift costs 1 experience.<br /> Buying a new dot of Renown costs 3 experiences.<br /> Rites cost 1 experience per dot, and you can spend up to 5 of your starting Merit dots on Rites.<br /> Buying a new dot of Primal Urge costs 5 experiences, and you can spend starting Merit dots on Primal Urge (5 dots to start at PU2, 10 dots to start at PU3)<br /> Harmony canot be increased or decreased with experiences.<br /> <br /> I think that's everything.<br /> <br /> If you create an unofficial Wolf-Blooded character sheet, and/or Other Pack Members character sheet, it would be awesome for Wolf-Blooded to have a spot on the sheet for a second Tell (in case they take the Tell Merit), a spot for Pack Rites (since Wolf-Blooded and human pack members can learn them), and for Totem to be included on the drop-down menu for Merits, since Wolf-Blooded can take one dot of Totem if they have the one-dot version of Pack Bond, or up to five dots if the have the three-dot version.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 04-24-2015, 08:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T20:31:52-07:00","id":491224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=491091#post491091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unlocking a new Shadow Gift costs 3 experiences if it's in-Auspice or in-Tribe, 5 experiences otherwise. Currently there is only one Moon Gift per Auspice, but once more are available, it'll cost 5 experiences to unlock a new one.<br /> Buying a new Facet of an unlocked Shadow or Moon Gift costs 2 experiences. Buying a new Facet of a Wolf Gift costs 1 experience.<br /> Buying a new dot of Renown costs 3 experiences.<br /> Rites cost 1 experience per dot, and you can spend up to 5 of your starting Merit dots on Rites.<br /> Buying a new dot of Primal Urge costs 5 experiences, and you can spend starting Merit dots on Primal Urge (5 dots to start at PU2, 10 dots to start at PU3)<br /> Harmony canot be increased or decreased with experiences.<br /> <br /> I think that's everything.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, thanks! I appreciate that!!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=491091#post491091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you create an unofficial Wolf-Blooded character sheet, and/or Other Pack Members character sheet, it would be awesome for Wolf-Blooded to have a spot on the sheet for a second Tell (in case they take the Tell Merit), a spot for Pack Rites (since Wolf-Blooded and human pack members can learn them), and for Totem to be included on the drop-down menu for Merits, since Wolf-Blooded can take one dot of Totem if they have the one-dot version of Pack Bond, or up to five dots if the have the three-dot version.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I'll see what I can do. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","