tion, experiences chart and Skill Proficiencies(on page 3), and the stuff for the Pack Members sheet).<br /> <br /> Take a look and see what you think:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/WtF/WtF_2ndED_Unofficial_2-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/WtF/WtF_2ndED_Unofficial_4-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/WtF/WtF_2ndED_PackMembers_Unofficial_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Hope you like em!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Gah, a day late on my comments. Sorry, Mr Gone, for my delay. Work has been trying. And then I caught the French Plague!<br /> <br /> One tiny thing: The merit &quot;Controlled Burn&quot; is instead &quot;Controller Burn&quot; in the dropdown menu of merits.<br /> <br /> A few big things. These would require a more in-depth overhaul. (moreso 2 and 3)<br /> <br /> #1 I think that the forms section would look nicer if each form had a row for the physical traits and manipulate: e.g. (oh god how does I formatting)<br /> <br /> <b>Hishu Dalu<br /> Strength 2 Strength(+1) 3<br /> Stamina 3 Stamina(+1) 4<br /> Dexterity 4 Dexterity(+0) 4<br /> Manipulate 3 Manipulate(-1) 2</b><br /> <br /> etc.<br /> That way all the physical attributes are visible at a glance, regardless of what form you're in and it all lines up nicely, horizontally.<br /> <br /> #2: The combat section is sadly utterly inadequate for the uniqueness of Werewolf. A full design hadn't come together in my head, but I was seeing some similar to the forms section actually, with claws and bite listed for each form (claws being replaced by brawl for forms without claws) as well as indications of special grapple rules (e.g. you can initiate grapple from a bite). They should all then have a few blank slots, hishu and dalu can use weapons, and quicksilver fleshed urhan make good gunslingers, for example. :-D<br /> <br /> #3: it'd be nice to have a better way to represent style merits in the merit section. Taking a new line for each &quot;rank&quot; can waste precious space and once you hit rank 3 in a style, you've not enough space to list how many total dots it actually is. On this one, I have no recommendations.<br /> <br /> Love,<br /> Flailbot<br /> <br /> Edit: And, as always, thanks for the sheets. They're nice!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T13:02:46-07:00","id":491874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=491753#post491753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These are awesome, thank you!</div> </div> </div> </div>You're very welcome! Thanks for the help. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FlailBot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=491794#post491794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gah, a day late on my comments. Sorry, Mr Gone, for my delay. Work has been trying. And then I caught the French Plague!<br /> <br /> One tiny thing: The merit &quot;Controlled Burn&quot; is instead &quot;Controller Burn&quot; in the dropdown menu of merits.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thats funny, as the list I got from OP said &quot;Controller Burn&quot; and I just copied and pasted. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Anyway, I updated the sheets to correct that merit(including the Official ones on my site).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FlailBot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=491794#post491794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few big things. These would require a more in-depth overhaul. (moreso 2 and 3)<br /> <br /> #1 I think that the forms section would look nicer if each form had a row for the physical traits and manipulate: e.g. (oh god how does I formatting)<br /> <br /> <b>Hishu Dalu<br /> Strength 2 Strength(+1) 3<br /> Stamina 3 Stamina(+1) 4<br /> Dexterity 4 Dexterity(+0) 4<br /> Manipulate 3 Manipulate(-1) 2</b><br /> <br /> etc.<br /> That way all the physical attributes are visible at a glance, regardless of what form you're in and it all lines up nicely, horizontally.<br /> <br /> #2: The combat section is sadly utterly inadequate for the uniqueness of Werewolf. A full design hadn't come together in my head, but I was seeing some similar to the forms section actually, with claws and bite listed for each form (claws being replaced by brawl for forms without claws) as well as indications of special grapple rules (e.g. you can initiate grapple from a bite). They should all then have a few blank slots, hishu and dalu can use weapons, and quicksilver fleshed urhan make good gunslingers, for example. :-D<br /> <br /> #3: it'd be nice to have a better way to represent style merits in the merit section. Taking a new line for each &quot;rank&quot; can waste precious space and once you hit rank 3 in a style, you've not enough space to list how many total dots it actually is. On this one, I have no recommendations.<br /> <br /> Love,<br /> Flailbot</div> </div> </div> </div>They are some things to consider. Maybe for some type of alternative sheet. Not really sure on 2 and 3 off hand, but it's something to think about. Not a bad idea about number 1... something to think about. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FlailBot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=491794#post491794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: And, as always, thanks for the sheets. They're nice!</div> </div> </div> </div>You're welcome! Glad you like how it turned out(so far). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T09:03:56-07:00","id":492619,"title":"","content":"Hello Mr. Gone! I love the new Wolf-Blooded sheets! They are awesome and make it easy to manage human pack mates all at once <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> To make your werewolf sheets even better, I notice you have added a space for the weapon initiative modifier on GMC and VTR 2e sheets but not on those of werewolf. Would it be possible to add it I the 4 sheets combat versions?<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4990-de_k47","name":"De_K47","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T15:16:23-07:00","id":492966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>De_K47</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=492619#post492619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello Mr. Gone! I love the new Wolf-Blooded sheets! They are awesome and make it easy to manage human pack mates all at once <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Glad to hear you like how they turned out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>De_K47</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=492619#post492619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To make your werewolf sheets even better, I notice you have added a space for the weapon initiative modifier on GMC and VTR 2e sheets but not on those of werewolf. Would it be possible to add it I the 4 sheets combat versions?<br /> <br /> Thanks!</div> </div> </div> </div>Let me take a look and I'll see what I can do. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Done! The new versions is up on the site.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 04-26-2015, 06:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T09:50:12-07:00","id":510821,"title":"","content":"Hey, sorry to bother you with this sheet again, but would it be possible to add a spot on the Totem section for Manifestations? I've been writing them on the Numina line, but a separate line for them would be nice.<br /> <br /> Also, I noticed a slight mistake on the xp cost breakdown (probably my fault for not wording it more clearly when I gave you the costs, sorry for that). It lists In-Auspice Gifts as 3xp and In-Tribe Gifts as 5xp. It should be 3xp for both, and 5xp for gifts that are neither. Might be easiest to write as Affinity Gifts vs. Non-Affinity gifts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-16T20:09:53-07:00","id":516665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/466287-when-2ed-errata-and-char-sheets?p=510821#post510821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, sorry to bother you with this sheet again, but would it be possible to add a spot on the Totem section for Manifestations? I've been writing them on the Numina line, but a separate line for them would be nice.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll see what I can do. That section is getting a little tight, but maybe I can squeeze it in.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> 